Package: epo
Type: Package
Title: Enhanced Portfolio Optimization (EPO)
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Bernardo",
           family = "Reckziegel",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "bernardo_cse@hotmail.com")
Maintainer: Bernardo Reckziegel <bernardo_cse@hotmail.com>
Description: Implements the Enhanced Portfolio Optimization (EPO) method of
    Pedersen, Babu and Levine (2021) <doi:10.1080/0015198X.2020.1854543>.
    EPO stabilizes mean-variance optimization by shrinking correlations
    toward zero, which addresses estimation error in both the risk model
    and expected returns. Both the "Simple EPO" and the "Anchored EPO" (an
    anchor/benchmark-aware, Black-Litterman-like extension) are provided.
